  "title": "Baked Tilapia in Garlic and Olive Oil",
  "description": "Baked tilapia, marinated in garlic and olive oil. If you prefer to grill, get your grill hot and put the fish on aluminum foil; grill until desired doneness is reached.",
  "authors": [
    "Stephen Carroll"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-07-21T14:40:41-04:00",
